  "honest_finding": "Under leave-one-study-out CV, a generic control-vs-exposed classifier barely beats chance (AUROC ~0.51-0.56): the exposure signature is chemical/tissue/study-specific and does NOT transfer to an unseen study. Only 2/12 held-out studies (GSE121338 thyroid disruptors, GSE93532 wastewater effluent) show strong transfer (AUROC ~0.9). WITHIN-study CV is much stronger, showing the expression DOES carry real exposure signal when the study context is shared. The MolecularEncoder does not beat a plain logistic regression on this real task. This is the genuine data ceiling for cross-study toxicant-exposure transfer on these 12 GEO studies.",
  "elapsed_seconds": 164.6
}